    <briefdescription>
<para>A utility class to create <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_c_o_f_f" kindref="compound">COFF</ref> dllimport GOT symbols (__imp_*) and PLT stubs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If an instance of this class is attached to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_j_i_t_dylib" kindref="compound">JITDylib</ref> as a fallback definition generator, PLT stubs and dllimport __imp_ symbols will be generated for external symbols found outside the given jitdylib. Currently only supports x86_64 architecture. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
